      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans, sans-serif', fontSize: 14, color: '#C9A96E', letterSpacing: 3 }}>01 · OVERVIEW</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'LXGW WenKai, serif', fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FDF9F2', marginTop: 24, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>一个人<br />一部缩微的<br />中国当代史</Text>
